    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{5}{6}\\text{ m}$",
      "worked": "Width = area ÷ length.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Width}&=10\\div12\\\\&=\\frac{10}{12}\\\\&=\\frac{5}{6}\\text{ m}.\\end{align*}$$",
